@startuml
title 图4-4 管理后台登录与订单处理模块时序图

actor 管理员 as Admin
participant "Vue2 管理后台" as Console
participant "SysLoginController\n/若依鉴权" as Login
participant "ClOrderController" as OC
participant "IClOrderService" as OS
database "MySQL" as DB
collections "Redis" as Redis

Admin -> Console : 输入账号密码
Console -> Login : POST /login
Login -> DB : 校验账号密码
Login -> Redis : 写入会话/Token
Login --> Console : 返回 JWT Token

Admin -> Console : 查询/修改订单状态
Console -> OC : GET/PUT /cl/order/*\nAuthorization: Bearer Token
OC -> Redis : 校验 Token
OC -> OS : updateStatus / list
OS -> DB : 读写 cl_order
OS --> OC : 业务结果
OC --> Console : 统一响应
Console --> Admin : 刷新订单列表

@enduml
